exports[`buildPerSignalInstruction > retry-attempt shape (retryReason appended as trailing paragraph) 1`] = `
"# Signal under consideration

signal_id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
source: msgraph
captured_at: Wednesday at 2:23 PM UTC

Article candidate:
  proposed_title: Conditional Access for iOS
  primary_keyword: Conditional Access for iOS Authenticator

Signal content (redacted, first 500 chars):
Subject: Re: Conditional Access AADSTS50158 retry loop. From: <REDACTED:person>. Body: Confirmed — adding the device-compliance grant solved it. Took 40 min.

Set signal_id to the exact UUID above. Copy the evidence_phrase verbatim from the signal content. If nothing concrete is present, use the NO_SPECIFICS branch.

